&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Direct experience selling to accountants or accounting firms (despachos contables), with an understanding of how they evaluate and recommend tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Basic proficiency in Portuguese or a desire to learn it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Independent analytical skills using spreadsheets, SQL, or Python to evaluate conversion metrics and sales performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
