&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1052&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1052&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1054&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;Four-year college degree from an accredited institution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1201&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1201&quot;&gt;5+ years of sales experience, ideally in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;inbound or outbound&lt;/strong&gt; high-volume environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1286&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1204&quot; data-end=&quot;1286&quot;&gt;Track record of exceeding goals across TPV, credit lines, and customer acquisition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;Mastery of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1311&quot;&gt;Hubspot&lt;/strong&gt; or equivalent &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;CRM software&lt;/strong&gt;; meticulous pipeline management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1394&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;BANT qualification&lt;/strong&gt; and KPIs like DSLA, meetings per week, and activity per deal&lt;/p&gt;
