&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Leverage Local Network:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Use your existing relationships and deep understanding of Manaus&#39; business ecosystem, especially among decision-makers in finance, operations, and procurement, to open doors and generate qualified leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
