&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;Working proficiency in English and Spanish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in operations, strategy, or a related field—ideally in a LatAm fintech, payments, or high-growth B2B SaaS company. A background at a top consulting firm (Bain/BCG/McKinsey) or high-velocity startup is highly valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;Proven, expert-level AI automation track record. You have demonstrated experience architecting, scaling, and augmenting operations with AI at an enterprise level. This is not aspirational—we want to see complex, automated systems you&#39;ve successfully shipped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;Advanced hands-on experience building automated workflows with platforms like &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;78&quot;&gt;N8N&lt;/strong&gt;, Make, or Zapier—no-code and low-code fluency is a strict requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;Deep familiarity with enterprise systems of record, including CRMs like &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;72&quot;&gt;Hubspot&lt;/strong&gt; or Salesforce, support triage (e.g., Zendesk), data warehouses (e.g., &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;150&quot;&gt;Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;, Snowflake), and BI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;High comfort level working directly with LLM APIs (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) to build advanced operational tools and agents, with the technical acumen to bridge the gap between business operations and engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot;&gt;Exceptional analytical skills, with the ability to query data in SQL or build complex visibility models in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;107&quot;&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt; to drive executive decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,7,0&quot;&gt;A structured, strategic thinker with a strong bias for action: you break down ambiguous problems, make high-stakes decisions with incomplete data, and move fast while maintaining system integrity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,8,0&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, seamlessly translating technical AI solutions into business terms for senior stakeholders and business needs into precise specs for engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,9,0&quot;&gt;Proven role-specific execution in a fast-paced environment, showcasing your adaptability to fast-changing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,10,0&quot;&gt;An intrinsic passion for leveraging AI tools to automate workflows and redefine what is operationally possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Independent analytical skills using Python to drive data-informed decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;A good sense of humor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
