&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience in operations, strategy, or a related field—ideally in a LatAm fintech, payments, or high-growth B2B SaaS company. A background at a top consulting firm (Bain/BCG/McKinsey) or high-velocity startup is highly valued.&lt;/p&gt;
