&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience navigating&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;financial audits&lt;/strong&gt;, understanding documentation and compliance expectations&lt;/li&gt;
