&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A collaborative, solution-oriented mindset with a passion for building from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Latin American&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;regulatory and compliance standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comfortable using modern collaboration tools (Slack, Notion, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience in credit risk in Latinamerica working with B2B solutions&lt;/li&gt;
