&lt;p data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Identify trends in customer feedback and propose improvements to product or process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;Balance multiple incoming tickets while maintaining quality, tone, and timeliness in every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
