&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our Data team and help drive decision-making across Clara. In this role, you will be the bridge between raw data and actionable business insights. You will not only report on what is happening but help us understand &lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;267&quot;&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; it is happening, ensuring our teams have the accurate data they need to move fast and build financial solutions for companies in Latin America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;Design and maintain high-impact dashboards and reports to support critical business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;Conduct deep-dive data analysis to identify trends, patterns, and anomalies that drive product and operational improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
