&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Regulatory Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with regulated environments and multi-entity corporate structures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
