&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Financial Operations Lead / Global Controller&lt;/strong&gt; to join Clara’s dynamic finance team. This role offers a unique opportunity to help scale a best-in-class controllership function at one of the region’s top startups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll own controllership end-to-end, from the monthly close to the annual audit, while modernizing how the function operates. We’re looking for candidates with an AI-native mindset and proven experience automating key finance workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report directly to the CFO and work closely with the country controllers, as well as FP&amp;amp;A, Treasury, Legal, and our external auditors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re prioritizing applicants based in Mexico City and São Paulo, but are open to remote arrangements for the right candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Controllership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the month-end financial close and consolidation across all our entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our end-to-end annual financial audit, working closely with our external auditor and local controller teams. Plan the audit calendar, resolve technical accounting questions, and manage the relationship through to a signed opinion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a global perspective on our financial operations, supporting treasury, regulatory, tax, and other relevant requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong internal controls environment: policies, close checklists, and account reconciliations as we continue scaling toward public-market expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support lenders, investors, and regulators with audited financials and relevant due diligence requests as they arrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Transformation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own NetSuite as our system of record, while also implementing AI tools and automation across the closing cycle and other key finance team workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a unified controllership operating model across our local teams so every country controller works the same way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 - 10+ years of accounting or controllership experience, including ownership of multi-entity, multi-currency consolidation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup and fintech experience is also a plus – you understand the regulatory and operational context of running finance in LatAm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading annual audits with a Big 4 firm from planning through opinion, including technical accounting memos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on NetSuite expertise – you can go into the system yourself, not just direct others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success deploying AI tools and automation to modernize financial workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in finance, accounting, or business. MBA or CPA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual proficiency in English as well as Spanish and / or Portuguese is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;172&quot; data-end=&quot;190&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;172&quot; data-end=&quot;190&quot;&gt;Why join Clara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
