&lt;p data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;1026&quot;&gt;Manage a dynamic portfolio of accounts, conducting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;sell-in, sell-out, and performance analyses&lt;/strong&gt; to uncover opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
