&lt;p data-start=&quot;1250&quot; data-end=&quot;1400&quot;&gt;Engage in strategic conversations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;CFOs&lt;/strong&gt; and finance teams by leveraging insights on budgeting, spend control, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;ERP system&lt;/strong&gt; integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
