&lt;p data-start=&quot;276&quot; data-end=&quot;631&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;296&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Key Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to own and grow strategic client relationships that drive long-term value for Clara and our customers. You’ll serve as the main point of contact for our most important clients in Mexico, combining commercial acumen with consultative insight to help them optimize their spend management through Clara’s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;633&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;In this role, you’ll proactively identify opportunities for growth and expansion, manage complex sales and onboarding cycles, and act as a trusted partner to C-level executives across our customer base. Your work will directly position Clara as the go-to financial partner for high-impact organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
