&lt;h2&gt;Language&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;English required — it&#39;s Clara&#39;s working language across all markets. Spanish required for this role: the product lives in the Mexican fiscal ecosystem, and deep CFDI knowledge is inseparable from Spanish-language regulatory context. Native or near-native Spanish is a strong preference. Portuguese is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
