&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Minimum 5 years of experience in high-growth sales environments (SaaS or Fintech preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Local Expertise: Currently based in Brasília with a strong, active network among finance leaders and key influencers in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Communication: Working proficiency in English and Portuguese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Execution: Proven track record of exceeding sales targets and managing complex negotiations independently.&lt;/li&gt;
