&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iklbwx&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2270&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2270&quot;&gt;Existing commercial network and proven experience working with enterprise customers across Colombia&#39;s Caribbean Coast (Barranquilla, Cartagena, Santa Marta, Montería, Valledupar, etc.).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
